meta {
  name: change-password
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

put {
  url: {{host}}/api/auth/change-password
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "currentPassword": "oldpassword",
    "newPassword": "newpassword123",
    "confirmPassword": "newpassword123"
  }
}

docs {
  # Change Password
  
  ## API Endpoint
  `PUT /api/auth/change-password`
  
  **Auth Required:** ✅ Bearer Token
  
  ---
  
  ## DTO (Request Body)
  
  ```typescript
  interface ChangePasswordDTO {
    currentPassword: string;  // Required - Password lama
    newPassword: string;      // Required - Password baru
    confirmPassword: string;  // Required - Konfirmasi password baru
  }
  ```
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Validation |
  |-------|------|----------|------------|
  | currentPassword | string | ✅ | Password saat ini |
  | newPassword | string | ✅ | Min 8 karakter |
  | confirmPassword | string | ✅ | Harus sama dengan newPassword |
  
  ---
  
  ## Response Structure
  
  ### Success (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Password berhasil diubah"
  }
  ```
  
  ---
  
  ## Error Responses
  
  | Status | Code | Message |
  |--------|------|---------|  
  | 400 | BAD_REQUEST | Password lama wajib diisi |
  | 400 | BAD_REQUEST | Password baru dan konfirmasi password tidak sama |
  | 400 | BAD_REQUEST | Password baru minimal 8 karakter |
  | 400 | BAD_REQUEST | Password lama salah |
  | 401 | UNAUTHORIZED | Token tidak valid |
  
  ### Error Example
  ```json
  {
    "success": false,
    "message": "Password lama salah"
  }
  ```
}
